seg-c14c586a29e7 = Three scenario kinds provide positioning, navigation and timing (PNT) with satellites in low Earth orbit (LEO) alone or fused with the medium-Earth-orbit (MEO) global navigation satellite systems (GNSS): <c1/> (position, velocity and time), <c2/> (precise point positioning) and <c3/> (a 5G non-terrestrial network). Source: <c4/>.

