seg-bd7fb6eb444a = Every workshop-derived number is in the <c1/> module of <c2/>, used by <c3/> (<c4/> enforces where they may appear). How the preset is withheld: every workshop-derived number of the engine lives in one file, <c5/>, which <c6/> compiles in only when it exists, and in the repository-only scenarios <c7/>. Deleting that file and those scenarios withholds the preset with no source edit; every other test, oracle and scenario runs without it, and the README's scenario-file count still counts the withheld files.

